@title Castlevania - Harmony of Dissonance (USA)
@file Castlevania - Harmony of Dissonance (U) [!].gba
@game ACHE
@chip SRAM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: the first save needs a save room inside the castle; the route found here (bridge chase, Entrance, break the atlas statue, the window hall) ends in the Shrine of the Apostates, where a brick pillar stops Juste and no way on to a save room was found
# Game Start > DATA1 > name "A" > story > bridge dialogue; climb over the
# wrecked machine on the bridge, outrun the giant armour (the drawbridge
# crushes it), Entrance: whip the atlas statue so its beam falls as a ramp,
# right through the window hall (zombies) into the Shrine of the Apostates.
# Findings (lockstep, same inputs): the bridge lightning flashes on different
# frames (f7220/f7480: only mgba white; f7765: all three in different
# phases); the armour's death flames are laid out differently in all three
# (f9730); heart drops from the hall's candles/zombies differ (on this
# script's route the Shrine shows dingbat-bios 11, mgba 10, nba 15 hearts;
# an earlier route with 300 more frames of walking gave 10/11/15); nba's
# Juste shows the whip pose where the others are already walking.

[new]
wait 600
press START
# until text START timeout=600 every=10  [reached dingbat-bios+10 mgba+10 nba+10]
wait 14
wait 30
checkpoint title window=30 compare=text
press START
# until text INFORMATION timeout=600 every=10  [reached dingbat-bios+100 mgba+100 nba+90]
wait 104
wait 30
press A
# until text DATA1 timeout=600 every=10  [reached dingbat-bios+20 mgba+20 nba+20]
